---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Daniel Araya">
  <section class="container-prose">
    <p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">A bit about me</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-text/85 leading-relaxed">
      {/* TODO: replace placeholder personal text. */}
      <p>
        My name is Dani and I like surfing. I'm a mathematician and simulation
        engineer working at the intersection of continuum mechanics, numerical
        methods and machine learning.
      </p>
      <p>
        I enjoy turning fuzzy physical questions into well-posed boundary-value
        problems, then turning those into code that runs fast on real machines.
        Most of my work lives somewhere between finite elements, multiphysics
        couplings and data-driven surrogates.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work, you'll usually find me in the water, on a bike, or
        rereading something by Strang.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
